	(text "Main I2C pull-ups R110/R111 sit on the MCU side, so the bus keeps working with onboard parts removed.\nQwiic: 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL. J11 connects the MPR121 module; J12 is free.\n4.7k in parallel with the module's 10k gives about 3.2k. Add up all breakouts' pull-ups when fitting more.\nJ8 mirrors the Waveshare WM8960 header pin for pin (from its schematic). Confirm the module before use.\nIsolate the onboard DAC (sheet 07) before driving audio through J8.\nWaveshare's codec uses address 0x1A and its own 24 MHz clock."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5c8f53c2-ad16-580f-afb4-32f8efee74d6")
